===============================================================================

ChatKit has been installed!

Next steps:

1. Run migrations:
   rails db:migrate

2. Configure your user model:
   Add a support_agent? method to your User model (or whatever model you specified)

   Example in app/models/user.rb:

   def support_agent?
     # Implement your logic here
     self.admin? || self.role == 'support'
   end

3. Add the widget to your layout:
   In app/views/layouts/application.html.erb, add before </body>:

   <%= chatkit_widget %>

4. Customize settings (optional):
   Edit config/initializers/chatkit.rb

5. Access the admin dashboard:
   Visit /support_chat/admin/conversations (requires authentication)

For more information, visit: https://github.com/robinfisher/chatkit

===============================================================================
